                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="b1e0-1801-bf43-f6a2" name="Verminous Communion" type="upgrade" hidden="false" page="75" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
              <costs>
                <cost name="Influence" typeId="f178-88bc-7258-0c88" value="15" />
              </costs>
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="e9e5-bd3f-8710-1360" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false" />
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile id="df61-67d0-5451-eba7" name="Verminous Communion" typeId="838e-a506-1f18-c702" typeName="Asset" hidden="false" page="75" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Restrictions / type" typeId="ea80-62e5-9e79-5ed4">Restriction: Vampire only.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">When using an ability that requires Line of Sight, this Character may choose a Friendly Character within 8" of itself and measure range and draw Line of Sight from that Character instead. For any effect that moves a target towards or away from the caster, use the chosen Character as the point of reference. The Character using the ability remains the caster for all other purposes. This does not apply to attacks.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry id="2c56-c722-e37d-b5b6" name="Inhuman Alacrity" type="upgrade" hidden="false" page="75" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
              <costs>
                <cost name="Influence" typeId="f178-88bc-7258-0c88" value="35" />
              </costs>
              <constraints>
                <constraint id="9ba8-9a90-0245-b8cc" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" percentValue="false" />
              </constraints>
              <profiles>
                <profile id="91ac-da84-3a28-e690" name="Inhuman Alacrity" typeId="838e-a506-1f18-c702" typeName="Asset" hidden="false" page="75" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Restrictions / type" typeId="ea80-62e5-9e79-5ed4">Restriction: Vampire only.</characteristic>
                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">Once during this Character's activation, if it damages an Enemy Character with a MELEE ATTACK, it may lose 2 VITALITY. If it does so, it may make a free SPRINT action. If it ends that movement ENGAGED, it may make a free CHARGE attack as if it had not attacked that turn already. If this movement takes the character out of ENGAGEMENT, it does not resolve a DISENGAGE TEST.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
