        <profile id="06c0-60ca-0d4e-ee75" name="Underdweller Kingdom" typeId="838e-a506-1f18-c702" typeName="Asset" hidden="false" page="75" publicationId="a21c-395e-03ec-6dcd">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Restrictions / type" typeId="ea80-62e5-9e79-5ed4">Unique. Restriction: Royal only.</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="a0d4-cc2f-58cd-e83f">After players have deployed their Characters, but before the game begins, you may place three 1” tokens anywhere on the board outside of 8” of an Enemy Character or Place of Power. These are SEWER TOKENS. While in base contact with a SEWER TOKEN, your characters may perform an Interact action to be placed in a legal position in base contact with another SEWER TOKEN. They may emerge in base contact with an enemy character and become ENGAGED. This placement generates no CHARGE attacks.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
